    "body": "Problem:\r\nOn a tag push, `actions/checkout` defaulted to neovim master, so `git push origin v0.12.5` shipped a `v0.13.0-dev` binary under the v0.12.5 release.\r\n\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nSpecify the ref value. Release titles are also improved, matching neovim's own releases.\r\n\r\nfix neovim/neovim#41915\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-19T13:24:08Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim-releases/pull/36#discussion_r4053288385"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim-releases/pulls/36"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim-releases/pulls/comments/4053288385"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "minor bug: if a manual run leaves tag_name empty, it will publish `master` as a release and overwrite `stable`.\n\nsame for line 151.\n\n```suggestion\n          ref: ${{ github.event_name == 'push' && github.ref_name || github.event.inputs.tag_name }}\n```",
            "commit_id": "13dd4f0ef66449971f8985d18493f4f3e94ddfea",
            "created_at": "2026-09-19T13:16:46Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -33,17 +33,20 @@ jobs:\n     env:\n       LDAI_NO_APPSTREAM: 1 # skip checking (broken) AppStream metadata for issues\n     steps:\n-      - if: github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch' && github.event.inputs.tag_name != 'nightly'\n+      # Release build: the pushed tag, or the version typed into workflow_dispatch\n+      - if: github.event_name == 'push' || (github.event_name == 'workflow_dispatch' && github.event.inputs.tag_name != 'nightly')\n         uses: actions/checkout@v7\n         with:\n           repository: 'neovim/neovim'\n-          ref: ${{ github.event.inputs.tag_name }}\n+          ref: ${{ github.event.inputs.tag_name || github.ref_name }}",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim-releases/pull/36#discussion_r4053288385",
            "id": 4053288385,
            "line": null,
